#Sydney666's Realistic Hunger and Thirst Version 1.1
#The mod is lore friendly and adds subjective realism to 7DTD v2.5. The mod is created to tone down hunger and thirst for those who seek it. If you don't like it, or aren't seeking it simply don't use the mod.
#The changes mean that you will only need to eat and drink 1-3 times per day. A couple of tins of food, or 5 raw meat cooked to a charred meat meal will be enough to survive. 3-4 Mason Jars of water per day will keep you fully hydrated. Drinking and eating once a day, if struggling early on, should keep you alive barely. 
#"Grandpa's" items have not been altered in this mod.
#Seeing "Tested" below means the item was tested and confirmed to be working correctly in game. If something is marked Tested and not working, then please check your install or any conflicts. I won't be investigating issues if I can't replicate it. 
#Feedback is okay, but I wont be designing the mod for others. I have created this file so it's easy to edit.
#To edit it, change the "value" settings to what you prefer. $food is for satiation and $water is for thirst. Easy!

#Start Smoothies (Hazard Reducer)
#These were slightly buffed to match all other satiation or dehydration effects.
#Example : One affects hunger more than thirst due to their ingredients. 

<!-- Oasis Smoothie - Tested -->
<set xpath="/items/item[@name='foodOasisSmoothie']/effect_group[@name='Hazard Reducer']/triggered_effect[@cvar='$foodAmountAdd']/@value">30</set>
<set xpath="/items/item[@name='foodOasisSmoothie']/effect_group[@name='Hazard Reducer']/triggered_effect[@cvar='$waterAmountAdd']/@value">60</set>

<!-- Frostbite Smoothie - Tested -->
<set xpath="/items/item[@name='foodFrostbiteSmoothie']/effect_group[@name='Hazard Reducer']/triggered_effect[@cvar='$foodAmountAdd']/@value">90</set>
